    "body": "It's true that the Japanese language uses Chinese characters (\"kanji\"). I'm not sure what point you're making. The sentence you quote is still true.\r\n\r\nThere's no need to point out the historical origin of characters that each culture uses; we don't point out that the English phrase \"the first of February 2003\" uses Latin characters originally from Rome.\r\n\r\nClosing, since I don't think this is actionable, but happy to continue discussing in the closed thread.",
